{"id":"n62525-1-16","stage":0,"title":"차 · 车","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62525-1-16-1","ko":"짐은 어디로 옮길까요?","zh":"行李要搬到哪儿去呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"짐은","meaning":"行李，货物","explanation":"짐：行李，货物；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"짐","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71357","senseId":"1","lemma":"짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짐은","audio":"/audio/926d405079dfc7c843c4.mp3"}},{"text":"어디로","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디로","audio":"/audio/0fbbfd5af1ab3c98e173.mp3"}},{"text":"옮길까요?","meaning":"搬，移，挪","explanation":"옮기다：搬，移，挪；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"옮기다","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67843","senseId":"1","lemma":"옮기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"옮길까요","audio":"/audio/dc2f632dbfc293748981.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3d95bbb883f1e751","term":"짐","zh":"行李，货物","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3","entryId":"71357","definition":"为搬到他处而打包的物品。","pronunciation":["짐"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"51842eae1c09c04b","term":"옮기다","zh":"搬，移，挪","audio":"/audio/51842eae1c09c04b9499.mp3","entryId":"67843","definition":"使从一处到另一处。","pronunciation":["옴기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8e060dacb2e03d4750e9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62525-1-16-2","ko":"멀리까지 가져가야 하니 차에 싣자.","zh":"因为要带很远，咱们装到车里吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"멀리까지","meaning":"远处，远方","explanation":"멀리：远处，远方；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"멀리","audio":"/audio/f62a38710e04901c3e13.mp3"}],